      "title": "Krea2 Turbo refs — clean",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Same files as before.**\n\nUNET `KREA2/krea2_turbo_bf16.safetensors`\nCLIP `qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors` type `krea2`\nVAE `qwen-image/qwen_image_vae.safetensors`\nLoRA `#7` slot 1 `Krea2-aethernouveau-03_merged` @ 0.80\n\n**What changed vs the broken graph**\n- `#2` `TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus` has **no VAE**. VAE is decode-only (`#6` → `#9`).\n- **No** `FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod`. That packer + VAE latents is what rasterized after the Comfy update. Stock Krea2 Turbo has no reference-latent slot.\n- Refs enter as Qwen3-VL `Picture N` tokens only.\n\n**Use**\n1. Load stills into `#11` `#12` `#13`. Leave a Load Image empty / unhooked if unused.\n2. Name them in the `#2` prompt: `Picture 1`, `Picture 2`, `Picture 3`.\n3. Identity: *the woman from Picture 1*. Style: *in the line and wash of Picture 2*. Do not dump a frontal beauty headshot if you want an action plate.\n4. `#10` batch defaults to **1**. Raise later.\n\nOptional later: `#7` slot 2 `krea2_style_reference.safetensors` @ 0.7 if you have it."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Same files as before.**\n\nUNET `KREA2/krea2_turbo_bf16.safetensors`\nCLIP `qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors` type `krea2`\nVAE `qwen-image/qwen_image_vae.safetensors`\nLoRA `#7` slot 1 `Krea2-aethernouveau-03_merged` @ 0.80\n\n**What changed vs the broken graph**\n- `#2` `TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus` has **no VAE**. VAE is decode-only (`#6` → `#9`).\n- **No** `FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod`. That packer + VAE latents is what rasterized after the Comfy update. Stock Krea2 Turbo has no reference-latent slot.\n- Refs enter as Qwen3-VL `Picture N` tokens only.\n\n**Use**\n1. Load stills into `#11` `#12` `#13`. Leave a Load Image empty / unhooked if unused.\n2. Name them in the `#2` prompt: `Picture 1`, `Picture 2`, `Picture 3`.\n3. Identity: *the woman from Picture 1*. Style: *in the line and wash of Picture 2*. Do not dump a frontal beauty headshot if you want an action plate.\n4. `#10` batch defaults to **1**. Raise later.\n\nOptional later: `#7` slot 2 `krea2_style_reference.safetensors` @ 0.7 if you have it."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
